{"parse": {"title": "漫漫之夜行迹-08", "pageid": 56397, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-07\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">漫漫之夜行迹-08</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%BC%AB%E6%BC%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%A4%9C%E8%A1%8C%E8%BF%B9-09\" title=\"漫漫之夜行迹-09\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TN</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.B0.8F.E7.9F.B3.E7.B2.92\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"小石粒\">小石粒</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 小石粒</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_huanghun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>与命运对抗的故事，不全都那么动人心弦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在这个故事里，没有牧羊人，没有送信者，没有斯芬克斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>没有剑斩下任何一颗头颅，无人因此而生，无人逝去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>也无法对他人讲述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>我要面对的，是“启示”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那是一个看不见的敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它被描述为无上的智慧，天上的声音。它会在数字6中亘古流传，督促他们去完成领袖的使命。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它不是有形的水瓶，我也无法对灵魂铺以软垫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但她的第一句话启发了我——并非事事都需要完备的理由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——人总得做点什么，不论什么，也比只是等待要好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……那么，用知识对抗知识，是可行的么？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d8/Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_daoyubangongshi2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>将绘本除去，在我面前的书本也足以将这个不大的空间铺满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>倘若“启示”是一种注定将人充盈至完满的智慧，那么也许我能提前做些预习。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>就像在水瓶里预先放满石子，好让它不至于被轻易碰落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>唔，《几何原本》……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在学派内，那已然是最基础的读物，但我不敢说我真正懂得了它。正是最简明的读物，蕴含了最深刻的智慧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一个合适的开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每个人都有自己的灵魂数字，我并非在沙滩上追逐真理之人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>210和37都是极聪慧的孩子。但最重要的是，他们对真理有着无限的渴望。他们造船，做桨，兴致勃勃地向海面航行，在洋流中不知疲倦，不畏惧浪花击打船舷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而我是岸边沉默的礁岩，等待着命运的巨石终有一日将我击落，为这片海床填平沟壑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我能抗击那超然的力量吗？我能战胜那超越的意志吗？这几乎是不可能的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">亚齐：</div><div>……但无论如何，我总得做些准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>我坐在桌前，开始和自己交谈。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "漫漫之夜行迹-08"}}